# Leave this unset for local development.
# The Vite dev server proxies /api to http://localhost:3000 and forwards cookies
# on the same origin, so the HTTP-only auth cookie works locally.
# If you set this to another origin, that API must allow this app's origin
# with credentials. Do not put secrets in frontend environment variables.
# VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:3000/api
